    "description": "The Telecom SIM Deactivation API enables seamless and efficient deactivation processes for multiple SIM cards within the telecommunications system. This endpoint is designed for users who need to manage and deactivate SIM cards in batches, ensuring rapid responses to service changes and customer requests. Typical consumers include telecom operators, customer service representatives, and automated systems that require bulk SIM management capabilities. By utilizing this API, businesses can streamline their operations, reduce manual errors, and enhance overall service efficiency.",
